set {strymir_name} = "???"
audio music "res://assets/audio/music/styrmir.ogg"
[background arg="res://assets/backgrounds/Krishark Sea Stormy.png" fade="0.0"]
join Seyche left
join Strymir right
Strymir: So you do dare to return?
Seyche (Surprised): You! [pause=0.4]You’re...
Seyche (Determined): [lspeed=0.1]You’re.. [pause=0.4]Styrmir..
set {strymir_name} = "Styrmir"
Strymir: Correct. [pause=0.8]At least your mind is still intact. [pause=0.4]Seyche.
Seyche (Uncomfortable): I..[pause=0.4] Y-yes of course it is. Sir. Why wouldn’t it be?
Strymir (Cussing): Don’t act coy with me, woman! [pause=0.4]Last time we met; you acted with so little dignity and respect;[pause=0.4] it disgusts me.
Seyche: What?[pause=0.4][lspeed=0.1]... I..
Seyche (Normal): Sir,
Seyche (Uncomfortable): I’m not who I was before. I changed!
update Strymir (Mad)
[wait time="2.0"]
Seyche: I-..[pause=0.4] People go up to me and expect this Seyche from before but I’m NOT her
Strymir: ... Prove it.
Seyche (Uncomfortable): I don’t even-[pause=0.6] What?
Strymir: If you’ve changed. Prove it to me.
Seyche: ...
Seyche: ...How do I prove it.
Strymir: I shall send a great and terrible storm across these waters, one so great that your temples shall fall and your sailors shall drown.[pause=0.4] If your followers can weather the storm, you MIGHT get my approval.
Seyche (Determined): Yes sir.